# 第四百九十一部　预算前沿的凸几何

定义最小预算成本：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal C_{L,a}(\lambda)
=
\inf
\left\{
\mathcal R_a(\nu):
\begin{array}{l}
\nu\ge\lambda m_0,\\
\check\nu=\mathfrak W_L
\text{ 于 }(-2L,2L)
\end{array}
\right\}.
}
\tag{491.1}
$$

则：

$$
\boxed{
\Lambda_{L,a}(C)
=
\sup
\left\{
\lambda:
\mathcal C_{L,a}(\lambda)\le C
\right\}.
}
\tag{491.2}
$$

